tment and insurance products; and online and mobile banking services. It primarily serves individuals, small and mid-size businesses, and professional associations. The company was formerly known as Flagstar Financial, Inc. Flagstar Bank, National Association was founded in 1859 and is headquartered in Hicksville, New York.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Joseph M. Otting | CEO & Executive Chairman | Age 68 | Compensation: $4.7M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 5K people. Revenue per employee of $366K ranks in the below the sector median among Financial Services peers. Stock-based compensation of $11K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 13\u00d7 revenue per employee (reasonable relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (10/10).","financial_summary":["Flagstar Bank, N.A. is a mid-cap financial services business with a $4.2B market cap on $2.1B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +8% over the past three years and +13% annually across the full decade, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 9% against a 13% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","On the balance sheet, thin -0.1\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.4%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 984% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":9.838277885207061},{"text":"Piotroski score 2/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.0) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Operating margins 39% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 56/100): leveraged balance sheet under pressure; roic below cost of capital \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Insiders are net buyers (100% buy ratio) \u2014 insiders sell for many reasons but buy for only one","Large open-market insider purchases (net $0.6M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business","31 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Agri Bank China (OTCMKTS:ACGBY) versus Flagstar Bank, National Association (NYSE:FLG) Critical Analysis","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/10/agri-bank-china-otcmktsacgby-versus-flagstar-bank-national-association